OL,3,GNEWSAArson arrest after town centre
OL,4,Aflat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof arson with intent to endanger life
OL,8,Fafter a fire inside a town centre flat.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Ffire just before 14:00 BST on Saturday
OL,12,Fon King Street in Penrith.
OL,14,FCumbria Police said a small number of
OL,15,Fpeople sought medical treatment, but no
OL,16,Fserious injuries had been reported.
OL,18,FThe 45-year-old woman, from Penrith,
OL,19,Fremains in police custody for
OL,20,Fquestioning.
